:: Felix Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> are walking along, you realize that it is just about that time and tell him you have to leave. You notice a flicker of confusion and disappointment appear on his face, which is fair considering how little you’ve actually done together. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, you do?”</span> He says, <span style="color:LightCoral">his disappointment even more clear in his voice,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Okay then, well, I will see you later!”</span> <br>

